#. Description of the theme
#: style.css
msgid "Al Qamara Lite (Alqamara Lite) is a clean, fast and free WordPress theme for blogs, business websites and WooCommerce online stores, built on Bootstrap 5. Build the homepage from ready sections - hero, stats counter, about, features, latest posts, newsletter, call-to-action banner and three free widget rows - and set everything up in the Customizer with a live preview. Choose from three header styles with an optional top bar, a sticky or transparent header and a two-row desktop layout. Set your own colours and pick from five bundled font families. With WooCommerce active you get styled shop, product, cart, checkout and account pages, a slide-in cart, grid or list view, a sticky product gallery and a shop bar on phones. Three theme widgets (Posts & Products as a grid or slider, Category Showcase, Contact Info), four page templates, block editor styles, translation and RTL support and full keyboard navigation are included. All fonts, icons and scripts are bundled, so nothing is loaded from other websites."
msgstr ""

